 excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 马德望","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A9%AC%E5%BE%B7%E6%9C%9B"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89933452"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q748336"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159150325","name":"暹粒","country":"KHM","lat":13.36664,"lon":103.85003,"kind":"city","region":"KH-17","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"暹粒 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"今天的暹粒是柬埔寨最受欢迎的旅游目的地之一，古迹吴哥窟、大吴哥位于暹粒市北郊。\n依据柯本气候分类法，暹粒市属于Aw:热带干湿季气候，4至11月为雨季，12月至3月为干季。","culture":"暹粒在旧法国区和旧市场周围保存法国殖民时期和中国风格的历史建筑。\n亦有学者认为暹粒之名，可能来自古代中国对柬埔寨的古称──真腊。","see":"市内设有博物馆、传统飞天舞蹈表演、柬埔寨文化村、纪念品和手工艺品商店、丝绸农场、乡村稻田、渔村和洞里萨附近的鸟类保护区，以及国际化的饮酒和餐饮场所。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q11711","articleTitle":"暹粒","sourceRevision":89933073,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 暹粒","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9A%B9%E7%B2%92"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89933073"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11711"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159144643","name":"诗梳风","country":"KHM","lat":13.58376,"lon":102.98332,"kind":"city","region":"KH-1","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"诗梳风 · 地点概要","geo":"诗梳风位于南猛河畔，距离马德望西北64公里，位于波贝前往马德望和暹粒的三岔路口，也是金边通往曼谷公路必经城镇。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q855717","articleTitle":"诗梳风","sourceRevision":91544877,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘